{"id":"e551d27957ab42ad","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["57-thm-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-model]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-cardinal]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 保持 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a> 的字母表集合约定，不是 88 的签名元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S|\">\\(|S|\\)</span> 因而是该字母表的基数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，模型与结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 有无限模型，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak M,S)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\\land\\aleph_0\\leq||\\mathfrak M||)\">\\(\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak M,S)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\\land\\aleph_0\\leq||\\mathfrak M||)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a> 的基数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"||\\mathfrak A||\">\\(||\\mathfrak A||\\)</span> 缩写论域集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 的基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\kappa\\;[\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\Phi\\land||\\mathfrak A||=\\kappa)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\kappa\\;[\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\Phi\\land||\\mathfrak A||=\\kappa)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅有任意句子集并不能推出存在模型，更不能推出任意大模型；例如要求论域恰有一个元素的句子集。补入无限模型前提后，这是原结论所需的 Löwenheim–Skolem 基数谱形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"4377db68f8b53b52","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 保持 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的字母表集合约定，不是 88 的签名元组；$|S|$ 因而是该字母表的基数。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Se